{"id":"3589891688","kind":"answer","title":"如何看待2024年以来硕博大量扩招？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2024-08-10","updated":"2024-08-10","votes":210,"comment_count":20,"minutes":2,"chars":775,"keywords":["学校教育","教育补贴","学历信号","教育回报","大学学位"],"summary":"低学历歧视进一步加重 如果只有 10% 的优秀人才读过硕博，那么没有硕博学历并不意味着一个人就不够聪明或勤奋。但如果 90% 的优秀人才都有硕博学历，那么缺少硕博学位可能会让人质疑其智力和工作态度。 这将导致越来越多人不得不继续追求高等教育以保持竞争力。（生育率也会继续下降） 教育的社会回报进一步下降 硕博扩招需要政府的财政支…","question_detail_html":"<p>又及：近年硕博都在扩招，这个问题常看常新，所以改成了“近年”，消除歧义</p><p>编者注：翻问题日志可知，原提问意指“2024扩招”，但提问用字是“今年”，于是于2025，新增了大量“2025扩招”的相关回答，于是又有热心者修改提问标题。事已至此，故只能增补问题描述。</p><p>注2：问题是2024年提的，改成2024年以来即可。</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/663192558/answer/3589891688","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"低学历歧视进一步加重"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"教育的社会回报进一步下降"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"学历通胀持续加速"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"越来越多的人将成为负担"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"那怎么办？"},{"id":"sec-6","level":2,"title":"相关文章"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">低学历歧视进一步加重</h2><p data-pid=\"o6BgBa1f\">如果只有 10% 的优秀人才读过硕博，那么没有硕博学历并不意味着一个人就不够聪明或勤奋。但如果 90% 的优秀人才都有硕博学历，那么缺少硕博学位可能会让人质疑其智力和工作态度。</p><p data-pid=\"lKa-dmCb\">这将导致越来越多人不得不继续追求高等教育以保持竞争力。（生育率也会继续下降）</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">教育的社会回报进一步下降</h2><p data-pid=\"powaplKG\">硕博扩招需要政府的财政支出。而让更多人读硕博，会严重降低社会回报。读硕博的差学生越多，社会回报降低得越多。让更多人攻读硕博学位并不能显著提升学生的人力资本，对尖端科技的发展也没有作用。<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f6f7499341e5b34e9143d8a89b6e1854_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c999e161c3ef8982d60aa0e6a9d2d7db\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-c999e161c3ef8982d60aa0e6a9d2d7db_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1678\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f6f7499341e5b34e9143d8a89b6e1854_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c999e161c3ef8982d60aa0e6a9d2d7db\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c999e161c3ef8982d60aa0e6a9d2d7db_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1678\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d44244ee48c29a69c8812210df0b8b92_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c28119688e05af1edb01730ece83734a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c28119688e05af1edb01730ece83734a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1574\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d44244ee48c29a69c8812210df0b8b92_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c28119688e05af1edb01730ece83734a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c28119688e05af1edb01730ece83734a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1574\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-3\">学历通胀持续加速</h2><p data-pid=\"y-LPLQBe\">根据美国的经验，我们会看到送硕士学历的外卖员、博士学历的调酒师。扫地的和看门的也要本科学历起步了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e5b26318139e23e97afa47235b88fd38_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8a88c391f1d883a106416be1dadd41c4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8a88c391f1d883a106416be1dadd41c4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1290\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e5b26318139e23e97afa47235b88fd38_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8a88c391f1d883a106416be1dadd41c4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8a88c391f1d883a106416be1dadd41c4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1290\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-4\">越来越多的人将成为负担</h2><p data-pid=\"xw0X0fxK\">设想一个就业门槛，随着学历的不断提升而逐渐上升。在遥远的过去，或许你可以相当愚钝，完全没有情绪自制力，却仍能过上相当幸福的生活。随着门槛的上升，舒适地养活自己所需的学历越来越高。如今，在美国，大多数无法获得大学学位（这真的很难！）的人只能勉强维持生计，这绝对是一个新现象。不久的将来，甚至一些受过大学教育的人对社会来说也将不再那么有用。如此下去，直到每个人都成为负担。</p><p data-pid=\"OPsgydXN\">你说大不了去送外卖、开网约车？就算没有萝卜快跑，也会有冬瓜快跑、黄瓜快跑、茄子快跑等等来取代你。学历再高，反而越亏。</p><h2 id=\"sec-5\">那怎么办？</h2><p data-pid=\"NwwIFbWH\">停止浪费教育经费，拿出来发钱，提振内需不是靠口号。</p><h2 id=\"sec-6\">相关文章</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ad4a146e58446c9115f5c2a4b04ac596_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"2869\" data-image-width=\"3689\" data-tm-id=\"711285929\" href=\"#/post/711285929\">Thoughts Memo：反对补贴郁金香</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b137fc2b827cec7b007f73f5cf16464b_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"824\" data-image-width=\"1080\" data-tm-id=\"704078444\" href=\"#/post/704078444\">Thoughts Memo：你得到了教育，但这一切值得吗？——SSC 发表了一场毕业演讲</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-70d3b87970ce1ea70e939bd279582953_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1204\" data-image-width=\"1800\" data-tm-id=\"705713335\" href=\"#/post/705713335\">Thoughts Memo：反对学校教育的依据：引言</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-166d0b2ab1372ed9360709197e0ecc73_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"720\" data-image-width=\"1280\" data-tm-id=\"710759337\" href=\"#/post/710759337\">Thoughts Memo：《反对学校教育的依据》读书笔记</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 为什么当代科学家都如此平庸乏味？浅析科学如何以牺牲智力与创造力为代价筛选毅力与合群 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"712750254\" href=\"#/post/712750254\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"704078444","title":"你得到了教育，但这一切值得吗？——SSC 发表了一场毕业演讲","author":"Scott Alexander","votes":343,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"711285929","title":"反对补贴郁金香","author":"Scott Alexander","votes":96,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"705713335","title":"反对学校教育的依据：引言","author":"Zvi Mowshowitz","votes":95,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"710759337","title":"《反对学校教育的依据》读书笔记","author":"Jose Luis Ricon","votes":49,"minutes":9,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"712750254","title":"为什么当代科学家都如此平庸乏味？浅析科学如何以牺牲智力与创造力为代价筛选毅力与合群","author":"Bruce G. Charlton","votes":282,"minutes":38,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"709830942","title":"反对学校教育的依据：基础","author":"Zvi Mowshowitz","votes":48,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Zvi Mowshowitz"},{"id":"710365211","title":"反对学校教育的依据：拆分教育溢价以及思考智商","author":"Zvi Mowshowitz","votes":38,"minutes":13,"reason":"延伸深读 · Zvi Mowshowitz"},{"id":"697650592","title":"教育军备竞赛正在让韩国破产","author":"Shin Hyun-gook","votes":80,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shin Hyun-gook"},{"id":"713858417","title":"一位经济学家认为我们的教育系统基本上没用","author":"Scott Carlson","votes":218,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Scott Carlson"},{"id":"13065852973","title":"高等教育应当认真对待「信号传递批判」的理由及其潜在影响","author":"Chris Percy","votes":35,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Chris Percy"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3622016276","title":"你是否认同「鸡娃是对稀缺教育资源的极致竞追」？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":148,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 148 赞同"},{"id":"3573850898","title":"经济学家称现在大学生相当于以前中专生，去送外卖不吃亏，如何看待此观点？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1167,"minutes":25,"reason":"相似问答 · 1167 赞同"},{"id":"3572066632","title":"韩国超 400 万大学毕业生「躺平」，大企业大幅减少了面向应届生的招聘，暴露出韩国当前存在哪些问题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":46,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 46 赞同"},{"id":"113544382172","title":"教育投资的收益到底有多大？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":20,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 20 赞同"},{"id":"3598169152","title":"中国已经建成世界上规模最大的教育体系，接受高等教育人口达到 2.5 亿，对国家发展有哪些助力？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":374,"minutes":19,"reason":"相似问答 · 374 赞同"}]}